==English==
{{wikipedia|Rincon (meadow)}}

===Etymology===
Loaned from {{etyl|es|en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|rincons|rincones}}

# {{cx|US|southwestern US|lang=en}} A [[meadow]] on the south-facing upper slopes of a [[mountain]].
# {{cx|US|southwestern US|lang=en}} An abandoned [[meander]].
# {{cx|US|southwestern US|lang=en}} An interior corner; a nook; hence, an angular recess or hollow bend in a mountain, river, cliff, etc.

